    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438371
    m_Localized: '{0} shards, 1 refunded'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438372
    m_Localized: DEPART
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438373
    m_Localized: Keep your shards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438374
    m_Localized: Frostbound Pact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438375
    m_Localized: Bleed for power, or walk away unharmed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438376
    m_Localized: Bleed +10% damage (-15 HP)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438377
    m_Localized: Walk away (+2 shards)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438378
    m_Localized: Pulsing Crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438379
    m_Localized: Pry it open?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438380
    m_Localized: Pry +1 projectile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438381
    m_Localized: Leave it (+1 shard)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438382
    m_Localized: Sentinel Echo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438383
    m_Localized: Mimic the sentinels' cadence?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438384
    m_Localized: Mimic +15% fire rate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438385
    m_Localized: Heal +20 HP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438386
    m_Localized: Accept the pact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438387
    m_Localized: Choose recovery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438388
    m_Localized: TWIN SENTINELS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438389
    m_Localized: SENTINEL I
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438390
    m_Localized: SENTINEL II
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438391
    m_Localized: THE SENTINELS AWAKEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438392
    m_Localized: I  /  MIRRORED RITES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438393
    m_Localized: BREAK THEIR RITUAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438394
    m_Localized: II  /  SPLIT RITES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438395
    m_Localized: LAST SENTINEL ENRAGED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438396
    m_Localized: THE RITES ARE BROKEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438397
    m_Localized: FALLEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438398
    m_Localized: STEP 1 / 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438399
    m_Localized: SWIPE YOUR RIGHT HAND
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438400
    m_Localized: A fast horizontal swipe throws an energy wave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438401
    m_Localized: NORMAL ENCOUNTER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438402
    m_Localized: Use both hands. Keep the kill chain alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438403
    m_Localized: CHOOSE ONE RELIC
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438404
    m_Localized: Choose an inscription, then confirm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438405
    m_Localized: ELITE ENCOUNTER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438406
    m_Localized: Prioritize ranged Weavers and break the Tanks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438407
    m_Localized: VERTICAL SLICE COMPLETE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438408
    m_Localized: Score {0}  |  {1} kills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438409
    m_Localized: Use Restart to run it again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438410
    m_Localized: STEP 2 / 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438411
    m_Localized: POINT YOUR LEFT PALM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438412
    m_Localized: Hold an enemy in the blue cone to chain lightning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438413
    m_Localized: CLEAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438414
    m_Localized: UNLOCKED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438415
    m_Localized: Lance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438416
    m_Localized: Storm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438417
    m_Localized: Aegis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438418
    m_Localized: Single-target spear. Waves pierce through enemies and hit harder,
      but fire slower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438419
    m_Localized: Spread fan. Fires faster with extra projectiles, trading raw damage
      for crowd control.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438420
    m_Localized: Defensive bulwark. Reduces incoming damage at the cost of slightly
      slower waves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438421
    m_Localized: Pierce
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438422
    m_Localized: Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438423
    m_Localized: Overload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438424
    m_Localized: Multishot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438425
    m_Localized: Tempest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438426
    m_Localized: Eye of the Storm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438427
    m_Localized: Bulwark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438428
    m_Localized: Singularity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438429
    m_Localized: Phantom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438430
    m_Localized: Wind Shard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438431
    m_Localized: Splinter of caged wind. Hands fire faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438432
    m_Localized: Ward of the Vanquished
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438433
    m_Localized: Etched with the names of the fallen. When you tip toward death,
      their fury floods you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438434
    m_Localized: Vow of Ruin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438435
    m_Localized: An oath written in obsidian. Each fallen foe turns the next blow
      heavier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438436
    m_Localized: Twin Flame
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438437
    m_Localized: Two embers braided into one. Each beam multiplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438438
    m_Localized: Tidewarden Scale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438439
    m_Localized: A scale plucked from the sea-keeper. Stitches a wound for every
      three slain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438440
    m_Localized: Thorn Crown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438441
    m_Localized: A circlet of brambles. Each cut tightens the grip and quickens the
      next strike.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438442
    m_Localized: Sundering Fist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438443
    m_Localized: A gauntlet that breaks every world it strikes. A sharp jolt of damage
      on pickup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438444
    m_Localized: Stone Will
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438445
    m_Localized: A weight of mountains in the palm. Every shot lands harder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438446
    m_Localized: Starring Ring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438447
    m_Localized: A halo of bound starlight. Every dozen kills births a new beam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438448
    m_Localized: Gale Feather
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438449
    m_Localized: A feather sheared from a storm. Hands beat to a quicker tempo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438450
    m_Localized: Slaughter Mark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438451
    m_Localized: Each kill quickens the next. Stack speed forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438452
    m_Localized: Prism Flock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438453
    m_Localized: Eight kills, and another shard of light splits from your palm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438454
    m_Localized: Ember Heart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438455
    m_Localized: A smoldering ember bound in iron. Every shot lands heavier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438456
    m_Localized: Pain Echo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438457
    m_Localized: Resonates with each blow taken, hands surge with quickening rage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438458
    m_Localized: Brink Light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1088438459
    m_Localized: A lantern that ignites only at the edge of death. The first time
      you fall under thirty percent health, the light surges.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
